WEBVTT

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.330
Master Bell! Over there!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.250
Take out that nest!

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.000
FIRE BOLT!

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:30.880
Stay sharp!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:32.540
There are more incoming!

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:02.210
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.420
The Great Falls

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.420
The Great Falls

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:24.500
Hey Ouka? What exactly are we doing all of this for?

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.960
Is it a ritual to keep monsters at bay?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:29.500
I don't think that's quite right...

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.210
We're doing it to take advantage of the dungeon's nature.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.080
I only recently learned about this myself, but...

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:39.290
destroying the terrain causes the dungeon to focus its
attention on repairing that first,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.250
meaning it will stop spawning monsters for a brief time.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.290
Oh wow.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:47.170
You're so amazing, Mr. Bell!

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:47.790
Huh?

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:52.540
I mean, you're even the one who defeated the most
monsters on our way down here.

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.420
I always knew you were something special, but...

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.580
B-but now, it's like you're super special!

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:03.580
I agree. Adventurers at level 4 are
in a whole different league.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.540
Yes, I think so as well!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.750
The way that you move is different
from during the War Game...

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.210
Uh, I'm not sure how to put it.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.500
His moves are sharper.
Is that what you mean, Lady Cassandra?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.210
Yes! That's exactly it!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.170
It's really incredible!

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:20.290
Uh, thanks, you guys.

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:25.580
Okay! Enough chitchat!
Everybody get back to work on the double!

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.420
What's got you worried? Is it me?

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:35.580
Yes.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:40.500
I could sense that you had a very difficult time
when it came to matters involving the Xenos.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:45.250
I was concerned that you couldn't fight
against monsters anymore.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:51.540
And so, I must admit that seeing how
you acted on our way down here was a surprise.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.540
I decided that being a hypocrite was the best choice.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.750
You're a hypocrite, Little Rookie!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:02.920
Those who are vilified as hypocrites…
They are the ones who have the makings of a hero.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:06.790
Defeating other monsters in order to save the Xenos...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:12.080
It may be wrong, and some people may vilify me for it,

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.210
but I feel like being a hypocrite is what I should do.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.710
Master Bell...

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.960
What's with the long face?

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:25.130
I don't see any reason to be so concerned.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:26.670
He's gonna be fine.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.000
I know that!

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.460
Master Bell has become remarkably more...

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.040
well, dependable than he used to be.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:36.040
Yet, at the same time,

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.080
I can't help but feel like he's drawing
farther away from me.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.170
That doesn't change what a Supporter should do.
You just have to keep chasing after him

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.250
and providing the assistance he needs. Isn't that right?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.290
I'll be up in the front, staying by his side.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.710
Actually, I'm gonna work to outclass him.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.830
Try not to get left in the dust.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.380
Th-that won't be a problem!

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:03.170
Because I'm his Supporter and
the best partner he's ever had!

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.830
I would never let a louse like you get
the better of me, Master Welf!

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:07.540
Now that's more like it.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.580
Okay, enough with the punching!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.670
All right!

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:24.880
Bell Cranel's presence is having a positive
influence on the party as a whole.

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:28.380
He's not just pulling them along with his strength,

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:32.040
he's encouraging his allies and making sure
they all share the same commitment,

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:33.750
which stimulates their growth.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.330
Well, damn.

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:41.630
That pretty much just makes him a hero, doesn't it?

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:45.960
Let's dig in!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.330
Please eat as much as you like!

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.710
There's plenty of extra helpings to go around!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.380
I'm sorry you have to be all alone over there, Mr. Bell.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:58.080
No worries! I'm enjoying the food!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:05.040
I asked Lady Aisha for help to add medicinal herbs and
fruits that grow in the dungeon to this dish,

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.000
and I have to say it turned out quite tasty!

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.130
Yeah. It's a unique flavor, but I like it.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.920
I've never had anything like this, even outside of Orario.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.960
There are no ingredients like this out in the Far East.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.710
The dungeon sure is mysterious!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:21.750
Master Ouka, you should be praising
the cooks for their work instead!

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.670
Particularly, Lady Chigusa.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:24.290
Huh?

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.630
Ms. Lili! Don't concern yourself with me!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:32.830
Excuse me. The food is quite delicious,
but aren't you concerned about using too much water?

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:36.130
I've had bad experiences like that before.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:41.290
Running out of water mid-expedition and being forced
to turn back after coming so far...

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.290
There are a number of springs on
these levels where we can get water.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:46.250
And even more if we proceed further down.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.330
We don't have to worry about different factions stealing
water from each other like the Apollon Familia.

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:52.000
That would just be silly.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.290
If you say so...

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.250
Shush! Quit drudging up bad memories!

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:58.790
She's right!

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.580
I have to say, this feels very strange.

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.380
Washing dishes in the middle of the dungeon.

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.670
Indeed. It almost feels like we're back at home.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:14.380
Anyway, we've made it all the way down to the 24th floor.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.880
That's the end of the middle floors.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.580
I doubt we would have made such quick progress
without Master Bell in our party.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.880
I was so overjoyed.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:29.420
When Master Bell came and asked us to join the
expedition, so that we could grow stronger together.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.670
I'm still just a fledgling sorcerer,

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.000
but I want to prove useful to Master Bell.

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:39.130
Although I may end up being a hindrance
to you and the others, Lady Mikoto.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.040
Don't be ridiculous.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:48.460
Come what may, I fully intend to protect you
with my life, Lady Haruhime.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.250
Oh Mikoto...

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:54.960
I made sure to get fighting fit. Lord Takemikazuchi put
me through some really rigorous training, let me tell you!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.790
Whaddya think, Bell?
Are you finding Hakugen easy to use?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.540
It's the absolute best!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:07.130
I was honestly stunned by how impressive it is.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:10.540
It cuts through even the toughest monsters
like a knife through butter!

00:08:10.830 --> 00:08:13.750
Well yeah, I used a unicorn horn to make it after all.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.580
But the Lil Squeak gave me a tongue lashing for it.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:19.380
She says I shouldn't give you any preferential treatment.

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:22.040
Done. Let's see your other one.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:27.130
I'm trying to get used to wielding Hakugen,
so I haven't used the Goddess' knife much at all...

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.830
I figured. But it doesn't hurt to be prepared.

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:34.880
Say, Welf. That knife was made from mithril, right?

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:35.880
Yep.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:38.880
Not only is it easy material to work with,
but it also has high magic conductivity.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.750
It's one of the best ingots you can get.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:45.000
But even though it transmits magic well,
that doesn't mean it can be magically empowered.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.380
The blade will just disperse any magic
that you try to imbue it with.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:49.960
Here.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:57.670
So it has high magic conductivity,
but it can't store any of it... hm.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.830
You've done even better than I expected.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.290
Your orders were very precise
and nobody doubted them.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.080
It's just like I figured. You're perfect for a strategist.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.960
Thank you.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.420
I owe it all to you for teaching me
what I needed to know before we left.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.670
There's only one problem...

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.500
We're about to enter the lower floors, which
are something that even we don't have experience with.

00:09:21.250 --> 00:09:23.460
That makes it hard to predict what will happen.

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:27.000
And the strategist needs to take the worst
possible scenarios into account.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.080
Worst possible scenarios?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.500
Yeah. The dungeon is a cruel tyrant.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.630
There are going to be times
when you have to be heartless.

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:39.920
That being said, I think you're capable
of making level-headed decisions.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.830
I still felt an awful sense of foreboding
even after I woke up.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:49.710
And no matter what I say to Daphne,
she just won't believe me!

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:53.790
Oh? Was your dream really that horrifying?

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.250
I saw this very creepy green moss that grew
and spread all over everything!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:01.630
It's definitely a sign of bad things to come!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.040
It's going to be okay.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.330
No matter what happens, our party can handle it.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.000
Ms. Chigusa?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:15.460
So just relax and let's go to sleep...

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:21.380
Sure...

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:29.080
It's time for the shift change.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.040
Oh?

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:32.170
Doesn't feel like it's been that long.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:35.130
Thank you, Ms. Aisha.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.920
I'm glad that we have you on this expedition.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.460
Don't mention it.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.750
More importantly, we're only a stone's throw away
from the passage that can take us further down.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.790
We'll be launching our attack
on the lower floors tomorrow.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.170
The lower floors...

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.920
This party depends entirely on you.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.960
If you bite the dust out there,
the whole party will follow suit.  

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:55.500
So I'm giving you fair warning.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:59.040
The part of the dungeon that we're about
to enter is an entirely different beast.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:01.880
The lower floors, and the deep floors...

00:11:02.630 --> 00:11:04.170
The father down that you adventure,

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.750
the clearer you will come to realize just how brutal
and insane the dungeon really is.

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:09.750
Bell Cranel.

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.960
Are you truly ready to step foot into that kind of world?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.380
Coexistence between humanity and the Xenos

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:21.170
is impossible until the deepest level of
the dungeon has been conquered.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.790
I would be lying if I said I wasn't afraid.

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:27.630
Still...

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.130
I want to keep pressing on!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.330
That's the kind of expression I like to see.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.460
It's even better than before.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.250
Whoa...

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.040
The 25th floor, Water City...

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:04.960
So these are...

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.250
the Great Falls?

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:13.420
That humongous waterfall continues
all the way down through the 27th floor.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.000
As you can see, there's basically no chance
of survival if you fall, so watch your step.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.790
I definitely will...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.080
Just how long does this path go on for?

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.630
Per the map, we should be
reaching a side tunnel shortly.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.580
After we enter that, Lady Aisha said that things
should return to the usual maze-like layout.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.290
Is that the spot where we came in from?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.960
The scale of everything in here is so big,
it really screws with your distance perception.

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.750
There's so much water here, where does it all go?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.290
I know the dungeon is supposed to be incredibly vast,
but it feels like it should overflow at some point.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:49.750
From what I understand, the majority of it eventually
flows out into a lake that's near Orario.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:55.880
And I heard that long ago, aquatic monsters actually
expanded out into the sea through that route.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:13:00.130
In which case, there must be monsters lurking
within the water of these falls as well.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.460
It seems so.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.580
Okay, everyone. It's time to review our mission.

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:09.580
The items we need to retrieve are:
ten shells from Blue Crabs.

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:14.540
Along with three fins from Aqua Serpents
or thirty fangs from Raider Fish.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:18.960
Or if we aim for rare monsters,
then we just need one mystic crystal of the Carbuncle.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:22.380
If we choose resources, we need to gather
a thousand grads of Azure Stone.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:27.790
As for the expedition itself, we've already made it
as far as we need to for the floor requirement.

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:32.080
I don't think it's necessary for us
to push further and try to reach the 26th floor.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.710
I agree with that.

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:37.380
Everything's gone smoothly so far,
but this is unexplored territory for us.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.250
Exactly.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:43.880
For the rest of our expedition, I suggest we use the
campground on the 24th floor from yesterday as a base,

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.500
and come down here each day
to gradually explore the 25th floor.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.830
Master Bell,

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.290
does that work for you?

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:52.130
Yeah. Sounds good.

00:13:57.710 --> 00:14:00.880
There are rapids that run
across various areas on this floor.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:05.130
Although we're equipped with the Undine Cloth
to help protect against water-based attacks,

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:07.380
it's best to exercise caution.

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:10.670
As much as I hate to bring this up right now...

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:15.880
aside from Lady Aisha, we prepared supplies and
equipment for everyone including the Undine Cloths,

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:18.330
a newly-made Goliath Robe,

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:24.080
and an extravagant amount of rare items
that Master Welf bought to craft new gear.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:28.500
Needless to say, it ended up
costing us a REALLY hefty sum!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.500
Remember that!

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:32.330
You're going to have to work
EXTRA hard on this expedition

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:36.080
and help us recoup the money that
was spent to come in the first place!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:39.880
To be blunt, anyone who lets themselves get defeated
by monsters is just wasting precious time!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:41.920
M-Ms. Lili is so intimidating...

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:48.290
Well, provided that our expedition ends as planned,
we should easily be able to earn that and then some.

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.420
Get ready. We have company.

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.830
Blue Crabs!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.210
Creepy! I've never seen a crab walk straight like that!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.880
No time for talk!

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.630
Look, we've already got two Blue Crab Shells!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.460
What a great start!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.210
I gotta say that was kind of anticlimactic for being
our first battle on the lower floors.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:16.460
We shouldn't let it go to our heads, though.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:20.960
It's crazy... there really is water flowing
just about everywhere on this floor.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.420
Remember that it's not the water
you have to worry about.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.960
Anyway, just be careful because a fall
from here could cost you your life.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.290
R-right, I'll watch my step.

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:37.540
It really does move fast.
Falling in would send you downstream in no time.

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:41.790
That is part of the problem,
but the real danger comes from the monsters.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:46.420
Spend too long treading water and you'll die
in agony after becoming their plaything.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.630
P-plaything?!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:53.460
All of the water that flows on this floor
is connected to the Great Falls.

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:55.830
Even if you manage to escape the monsters,

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.040
you'll almost certainly be smashed into a
bloody pulp if you fall down towards the basin.

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:02.210
Yikes. It's scary just thinking about it!

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:05.790
Aquatic monsters have the home-field
advantage when underwater.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.080
We'd have no hope of putting up a fight against them.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:12.710
Also, be sure to take great care whenever you walk
along the water's edge like this.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.830
What for, exactly?

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:30.330
Smooth move, Absolute Shadow!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:34.380
Seems like you'll be just fine protecting
that bungling little fox on your own.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:38.040
I swore to Lady Haruhime just last night
that I would keep her safe,

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.380
no matter what came at us.

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.330
Mikoto, my savior!

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:46.710
Uh, um, th-thanks?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:50.000
Hey! Look over there, Bell!

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:52.460
Is that what I think it is?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.170
Under Coral?!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:57.380
I remember reading in the field guide that
this is the only place it can be found.

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.250
That's right!

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:01.210
I saw it once before when I paid
Goddess Hephaistos a visit.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:05.790
I think it would make good material for a weapon.
Is there any way we could get some?

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.080
Don't be ridiculous, Master Welf!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.000
We just saw what kind of threat the water here poses!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.500
There's too much risk in trying to cross it just for that!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.540
I bet we could sell that Under Coral
for a small fortune.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:20.080
Wow. There's actually an Under Pearl
stuck inside of it, too.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.830
Very well! Let's hurry across and get as much as we can!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.130
You're ticking me off, Lil Squeak.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.040
I wasn't expecting the two of us to get saddled with
fetching duty.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:34.580
Well, we don't have any specialists like
a thief or a scout in our party.

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:38.040
Whoa, there it is! I see an Under Pearl in here!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:42.960
Please make your way back soon!
Being too greedy will only land us in big trouble!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:44.540
That's rich coming from you!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.290
Sure thing! We're coming back now!

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:05.420
Was that a somersault?!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.710
That was a crazy move you used back there!

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:17.290
It's a martial art technique that Lord Takemikazuchi
was kind enough to teach me before we left.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:19.130
It certainly came in handy!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:22.380
Sweet! This is some high-quality stuff!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:26.460
No kidding! I think this alone could fetch upwards of
3 million valis!

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:30.540
Better yet, you could pawn it off
for 3.5 million with enough smooth talking.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.250
D-did you say three and a half million valis?!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.420
Hooray for expeditions! Hooray for the lower floors!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:38.750
Ms. Lili, your eyes are scaring me...

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.880
Now it's really starting to feel like an expedition.

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:45.170
I sure hope Bell is doing okay out there.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:49.000
They say the middle floors and lower floors are worlds
apart.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.880
I wish I could have given him more info.

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.040
Quests like these are really on the rise lately...

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.670
Search parties looking for
missing people on the lower floors.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:02.380
If I remember right, Mr. Luvis and Mr. Dormul were also

00:19:02.380 --> 00:19:06.000
in parties that were heading for
the lower floors to perform a search.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:10.710
Maybe I'm just overthinking it, but...

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.170
I hope it's nothing serious.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:20.540
We're still on the same floor, but the terrain keeps
going up and down. It's such a bizarre layout.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:23.130
And it feels like we've walked pretty far in...

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:27.000
It's dangerous for us to get too deep
on our first day of exploring.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:29.670
Let's get ready to turn back after making a little
more progress.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:33.920
Good point. We still haven't even gone
halfway through the established route.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:41.790
Is it an adventurer?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:43.250
Seems like it.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:48.040
But from what I heard, there should be no other
Familia doing an expedition that overlaps with ours.

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:51.960
I recognize him!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:53.750
It's Mr. Luvis!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:57.130
Battle positions.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.670
He's acting strange.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.710
H-help...

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:24.290
STOP IT!

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:40.420
It's reading all my moves?!

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.710
This thing is different than any monster
we've fought today.

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:50.330
Wait a second!

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.750
Is it an enhanced species?!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.250
Don't go in too deep!

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:08.420
Backup is on the way!

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.920
No, don't!

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.250
You must... run!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.130
Avoid that attack...

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.830
Don't get hit!

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:37.880
Lady Chigusa!

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.460
I don't believe it. The monster ran away?!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:50.500
Chigusa!

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.920
Hang in there, Chigusa!

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:02.330
It's the green moss...

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.130
that will engulf everything...

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Next Time

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Parasite

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Viscum Album

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.540
Next time: Parasite.
